{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23539","headline":"赴苏州至常州荅贾舍人 · 白居易","name":"赴苏州至常州荅贾舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杭城隔岁转苏台，还拥前时五马回。\n厌见簿书先眼合，喜逢桮酒暂眉开。\n未酬恩宠年空去，欲立功名命不来。\n一别承明三领郡，甘从人道是粗才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}